seg-8c12958898a8 = Kshana's central honesty discipline is that <b>every sensor parameter, physical model, and validation dataset is traceable to a published source</b> — a datasheet, a peer-reviewed paper, a signal-in-space ICD (interface control document), or a standard. This document collects those provenance strings into a single citable reference table.

